  "pages": [
    {
      "id": "page-1",
      "title": "The Awakening",
      "atmosphereId": "atmo-house",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "id": "p1-1",
          "text": "<p>You wake up in a <strong>dimly lit room</strong>. The air is cold, and you can scarcely see your own hands, <em>{{playerName}}</em>.</p>"
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-2",
          "text": "<p>A heavy wooden door stands to your north. To your right, a <span class=\"contextual-text-mark\" data-context=\"The window is covered in soot and barely lets any light in. At the bottom right corner, there is a small crack.\">small window</span> lets in a sliver of moonlight.</p>"
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-3",
          "text": "<p>You try to remember how you got here, but your mind is a blank slate. The only thing you are certain of is your training as a <strong>{{heroClass}}</strong>.</p>"
        }
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "c1-1",
          "text": "Inspect the door",
          "targetPageId": "page-2"
        },
        {
          "id": "c1-2",
          "text": "Look out the window",
          "targetPageId": "page-3"
        },
        {
          "id": "c1-3",
          "text": "Search your pockets",
          "targetPageId": "page-5"
        },
        {
          "id": "c1-pray",
          "text": "Kneel and pray for guidance",
          "actions": [
            {
              "id": "act-pray-msg",
              "blueprintId": "post_message",
              "trigger": "on_enter",
              "params": {
                "message": "A faint warmth washes over you. Perhaps the gods are listening."
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "act-pray-var",
              "blueprintId": "set_variable",
              "trigger": "on_enter",
              "params": {
                "variableKey": "heroClass",
                "value": "Blessed Knight"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c1-4",
          "text": "Lift the loose floorboard",
          "actions": [
            {
              "id": "act-go-cellar-choice",
              "blueprintId": "go_to_subplot",
              "trigger": "on_enter",
              "params": {
                "subplotId": "subplot-cellar",
                "targetPageId": "page-cellar-1"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "actions": [
        {
          "id": "act-leave-awakening",
          "blueprintId": "set_variable",
          "trigger": "on_exit",
          "params": {
            "variableKey": "hasVisitedStart",
            "value": "true"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "page-2",
      "title": "The Locked Door",
      "atmosphereId": "atmo-house",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "id": "p2-1",
          "text": "<p>The door is made of solid oak, reinforced with <span class=\"contextual-text-mark\" data-context=\"The iron bands are rusted, but thick. Forcing the door open without a tool seems impossible.\">iron bands</span>. You rattle the iron handle, but it doesn't budge.</p>"
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-2",
          "text": "<p>There seems to be no keyhole. How peculiar.</p>"
        }
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "c2-1",
          "text": "Go back to the center of the room",
          "targetPageId": "page-1"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "page-3",
      "title": "A Glimpse Outside",
      "atmosphereId": "atmo-house",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "id": "p3-1",
          "text": "<p>You peer through the dusty glass. Outside, an endless forest of towering pines stretches out beneath a starlit sky.</p>"
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-2",
          "text": "<p>Suddenly, you notice a faint glow moving through the trees. It looks like... a <span class=\"contextual-text-mark\" data-context=\"A spherical object emitting a warm, pulsating orange light. It bobs up and down rhythmically.\">floating lantern</span>.</p>"
        }
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "c3-1",
          "text": "Watch the glow closely",
          "targetPageId": "page-4"
        },
        {
          "id": "c3-2",
          "text": "Step away from the window",
          "targetPageId": "page-1"
        },
        {
          "id": "c3-signal",
          "text": "Wave at the floating light",
          "actions": [
            {
              "id": "act-wave-msg",
              "blueprintId": "post_message",
              "trigger": "on_enter",
              "params": {
                "message": "The light pulses twice — as if acknowledging you."
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "page-4",
      "title": "The Approaching Light",
      "atmosphereId": "atmo-house",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "id": "p4-1",
          "text": "<p>The glow slowly grows brighter and takes the shape of the lantern, held by a <span class=\"contextual-text-mark\" data-context=\"The figure is shrouded in a dark, worn cloak. You cannot see their face, only a pair of glowing yellow eyes from beneath the hood.\">cloaked figure</span>.</p>"
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-2",
          "text": "<p>The figure stops directly beneath your window, looks up, and beckons to you. They point towards a hidden lever beside your window.</p>"
        }
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "c4-1",
          "text": "Pull the hidden lever",
          "targetPageId": "page-end"
        },
        {
          "id": "c4-2",
          "text": "Ignore the figure and turn back",
          "targetPageId": "page-1"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "page-5",
      "title": "Checking Pockets",
      "atmosphereId": "atmo-main",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "id": "p5-1",
          "text": "<p>You pat down your clothes. You are wearing a simple tunic, but you feel the weight of your trusty <strong>{{weapon}}</strong> hanging at your side.</p>"
        },
        {
          "id": "p5-2",
          "text": "<p>Deep in your left pocket, your hand brushes against something cold and geometric. A <span class=\"contextual-text-mark\" data-context=\"The key has no teeth, just a complex series of grooves carved into strange, iridescent metal.\">strange golden key</span>.</p>"
        }
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "c5-1",
          "text": "Take the key to the door",
          "targetPageId": "page-6"
        },
        {
          "id": "c5-2",
          "text": "Keep looking around",
          "targetPageId": "page-1"
        }
      ],
      "actions": [
        {
          "id": "act-find-key",
          "blueprintId": "set_variable",
          "trigger": "on_enter",
          "params": {
            "variableKey": "hasGoldenKey",
            "value": "true"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "act-find-key-msg",
          "blueprintId": "post_message",
          "trigger": "on_enter",
          "params": {
            "message": "You now carry the strange golden key."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "page-6",
      "title": "The Hidden Lock",
      "atmosphereId": "atmo-main",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "id": "p6-1",
          "text": "<p>Holding the strange golden key, you approach the oak door again. Though there's no visible keyhole, bringing the key close causes a <span class=\"contextual-text-mark\" data-context=\"A shimmering projection of light forms a complex lock mechanism mid-air.\">holographic lock</span> to materialize on the wood.</p>"
        },
        {
          "id": "p6-2",
          "text": "<p>You insert the key. The door groans and swings open heavily, revealing a dark stone corridor ahead.</p>"
        }
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "c6-1",
          "text": "Step into the corridor",
          "targetPageId": "page-end"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "page-end",
      "title": "To Be Continued...",
      "atmosphereId": "atmo-main",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "id": "pend-1",
          "text": "<p>You take your first steps out of the room. The air changes instantly, carrying the scent of damp earth and old magic.</p>"
        },
        {
          "id": "pend-2",
          "text": "<p>A new adventure awaits you, <em>{{playerName}}</em>.</p>"
        }
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "cend-1",
          "text": "Walk into the forest",
          "targetPageId": "page-woods-1"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "page-cellar-1",
      "subplotId": "subplot-cellar",
      "title": "The Dusty Cellar",
      "atmosphereId": "atmo-cellar",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "id": "p-cell1-1",
          "text": "<p>You descend a rickety wooden ladder into the darkness. The air smells of mold and old wine.</p>"
        },
        {
          "id": "p-cell1-2",
          "text": "<p>In the corner, you see a small chest glimmering faintly in the dark.</p>"
        }
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "c-cell1-back",
          "text": "Climb back up",
          "actions": [
            {
              "id": "act-leave-cellar",
              "blueprintId": "go_to_subplot",
              "trigger": "on_enter",
              "params": {
                "subplotId": null,
                "targetPageId": "page-1"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c-cell1-2",
          "text": "Open the chest",
          "targetPageId": "page-cellar-2"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "page-cellar-2",
      "subplotId": "subplot-cellar",
      "title": "The Cellar Treasure",
      "atmosphereId": "atmo-cellar",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "id": "p-cell2-1",
          "text": "<p>The chest is unlocked! Inside, you find a handful of gold coins and an old, dusty tome.</p>"
        }
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "c-cell2-take",
          "text": "Take the tome",
          "actions": [
            {
              "id": "act-take-tome",
              "blueprintId": "set_variable",
              "trigger": "on_enter",
              "params": {
                "variableKey": "hasFoundTome",
                "value": true
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "act-take-tome-msg",
              "blueprintId": "post_message",
              "trigger": "on_enter",
              "params": {
                "message": "You carefully slip the dusty tome into your pack. The writing inside is in an unknown script."
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c-cell2-back",
          "text": "Return to the room above",
          "actions": [
            {
              "id": "act-leave-cellar-2",
              "blueprintId": "go_to_subplot",
              "trigger": "on_enter",
              "params": {
                "subplotId": null,
                "targetPageId": "page-1"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "page-woods-1",
      "title": "Deep into the Woods",
      "atmosphereId": "atmo-main",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "id": "pw-1",
          "text": "<p>You finally step past the heavy doors and outside into the cold, starlit night. The forest is vast, and the <span class=\"contextual-text-mark\" data-context=\"The trees are so tall they blot out the sky in some places.\">grand pines</span> loom menacingly over you.</p>"
        }
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "cw-1",
          "text": "Follow the mysterious glow",
          "targetPageId": "page-woods-2"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "page-woods-2",
      "title": "The Forgotten Shrine",
      "atmosphereId": "atmo-main",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "id": "pw2-1",
          "text": "<p>Following the faint orange light, you arrive at an ancient stone shrine heavily covered by moss. The figure is nowhere to be seen.</p>"
        }
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "cw2-1",
          "text": "Examine the shrine closely",
          "targetPageId": "page-woods-3"
        },
        {
          "id": "cw2-2",
          "text": "Ignore it and walk towards the sound of rushing water",
          "targetPageId": "page-woods-8"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "page-woods-3",
      "title": "Examining the Shrine",
      "atmosphereId": "atmo-main",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "id": "pw3-1",
          "text": "<p>The shrine is beautifully carved from a single piece of dark stone. At the center is a depression that looks exactly the shape of a tome.</p>"
        }
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "cw3-tome",
          "text": "Place the dusty tome in the depression",
          "targetPageId": "page-woods-4",
          "conditionals": [
            {
              "id": "cond-tome",
              "blueprintId": "variable_equals",
              "params": {
                "variableKey": "hasFoundTome",
                "value": "true"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "cw3-read",
          "text": "Read the inscription on the side",
          "targetPageId": "page-woods-5"
        },
        {
          "id": "cw3-leave",
          "text": "Walk away towards the river",
          "targetPageId": "page-woods-8"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "page-woods-4",
      "title": "The Inner Sanctum",
      "atmosphereId": "atmo-cellar",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "id": "pw4-1",
          "text": "<p>As the tome settles into the stone, a hidden door grinds open, revealing the Inner Sanctum. You step inside, feeling an intense magical pressure.</p>"
        },
        {
          "id": "pw4-2",
          "text": "<p>On a pedestal sits an ancient relic. You recognize it from your teachings as a {{heroClass}}.</p>"
        }
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "cw4-1",
          "text": "Take the ancient relic",
          "actions": [
            {
              "id": "act-relic",
              "blueprintId": "post_message",
              "trigger": "on_enter",
              "params": {
                "message": "You claim the ancient relic! You feel a surge of power."
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "cw4-2",
          "text": "Leave the sanctum and head to the river",
          "targetPageId": "page-woods-8"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "page-woods-5",
      "title": "The Inscription",
      "atmosphereId": "atmo-main",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "id": "pw5-1",
          "text": "<p>You brush the moss aside. The inscription reads: <em>\"Only those who seek knowledge in the dirt shall open the way.\"</em></p>"
        }
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "cw5-1",
          "text": "Ponder the meaning and walk to the river",
          "targetPageId": "page-woods-8",
          "actions": [
            {
              "id": "act-read-ins",
              "blueprintId": "set_variable",
              "trigger": "on_enter",
              "params": {
                "variableKey": "readShrineInscription",
                "value": "true"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "page-woods-8",
      "title": "The River Bank",
      "atmosphereId": "atmo-main",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "id": "pw8-1",
          "text": "<p>You reach the banks of a wide, dark river. An old wooden ferry is moored here, manned by a <span class=\"contextual-text-mark\" data-context=\"The ferryman is skeletal, his eyes glowing like embers.\">silent ferryman</span>.</p>"
        },
        {
          "id": "pw8-2",
          "text": "<p>He holds out a bony hand, expecting payment for the crossing.</p>"
        }
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "cw8-pay",
          "text": "Give him a river coin",
          "targetPageId": "page-woods-11",
          "conditionals": [
            {
              "id": "cond-coin",
              "blueprintId": "variable_equals",
              "params": {
                "variableKey": "hasRiverCoin",
                "value": "true"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "cw8-blessed",
          "text": "Show him your holy aura (Blessed Knight)",
          "targetPageId": "page-woods-11",
          "conditionals": [
            {
              "id": "cond-blessed",
              "blueprintId": "variable_equals",
              "params": {
                "variableKey": "heroClass",
                "value": "Blessed Knight"
              }
            }
          ],
          "actions": [
            {
              "id": "act-blessed",
              "blueprintId": "post_message",
              "trigger": "on_enter",
              "params": {
                "message": "The ferryman bows respectfully to a champion of the light."
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "cw8-search",
          "text": "Search the muddy banks for something of value",
          "targetPageId": "page-woods-10"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "page-woods-10",
      "title": "Muddy Banks",
      "atmosphereId": "atmo-main",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "id": "pw10-1",
          "text": "<p>You trudge through the mud along the river. After some digging, your hand strikes a hard, cold object—a tarnished silver coin!</p>"
        }
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "cw10-1",
          "text": "Take the coin and return to the ferryman",
          "targetPageId": "page-woods-8",
          "actions": [
            {
              "id": "act-get-coin",
              "blueprintId": "set_variable",
              "trigger": "on_enter",
              "params": {
                "variableKey": "hasRiverCoin",
                "value": "true"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "act-get-coin-msg",
              "blueprintId": "post_message",
              "trigger": "on_enter",
              "params": {
                "message": "You found a River Coin."
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "page-woods-11",
      "title": "Crossing the River",
      "atmosphereId": "atmo-cellar",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "id": "pw11-1",
          "text": "<p>The ferryman accepts your passage. The boat glides silently across the water, the fog thickening around you.</p>"
        }
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "cw11-1",
          "text": "Step off the boat on the other side",
          "targetPageId": "page-woods-12"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "page-woods-12",
      "title": "The Abandoned Camp",
      "atmosphereId": "atmo-main",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "id": "pw12-1",
          "text": "<p>You step onto the far shore and find the ruins of an old campfire. The ashes are cold.</p>"
        },
        {
          "id": "pw12-2",
          "text": "<p>Nearby, half-buried under leaves, is an ornate wooden chest with a golden lock.</p>"
        }
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "cw12-unlock",
          "text": "Use the strange golden key",
          "targetPageId": "page-woods-14",
          "conditionals": [
            {
              "id": "cond-goldkey",
              "blueprintId": "variable_equals",
              "params": {
                "variableKey": "hasGoldenKey",
                "value": "true"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "cw12-rest",
          "text": "Sit by the fire pit and rest",
          "targetPageId": "page-woods-15"
        },
        {
          "id": "cw12-leave",
          "text": "Continue into the dark forest",
          "targetPageId": "page-woods-16"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "page-woods-14",
      "title": "Inside the Chest",
      "atmosphereId": "atmo-main",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "id": "pw14-1",
          "text": "<p>The golden key slides perfectly into the lock. Inside the old chest lies a magnificent, glowing blade: the <strong>Radiant Sword</strong>!</p>"
        }
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "cw14-1",
          "text": "Equip it and rest by the fire",
          "targetPageId": "page-woods-15",
          "actions": [
