              "id": "act-equip",
              "blueprintId": "set_variable",
              "trigger": "on_enter",
              "params": {
                "variableKey": "weapon",
                "value": "Radiant Sword"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "act-equip-msg",
              "blueprintId": "post_message",
              "trigger": "on_enter",
              "params": {
                "message": "You equipped the Radiant Sword! Your attack power is immense."
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "page-woods-15",
      "title": "A Moment of Peace",
      "atmosphereId": "atmo-main",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "id": "pw15-1",
          "text": "<p>You strike a flint against some dry tinder and coax a small flame from the cold fire pit.</p>"
        },
        {
          "id": "pw15-2",
          "text": "<p>You inspect your {{weapon}} and steady your breathing. The night is far from over.</p>"
        }
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "cw15-1",
          "text": "Stand up and continue ahead",
          "targetPageId": "page-woods-16",
          "actions": [
            {
              "id": "act-heal",
              "blueprintId": "post_message",
              "trigger": "on_enter",
              "params": {
                "message": "You feel fully rested."
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "page-woods-16",
      "title": "An Ambush!",
      "atmosphereId": "atmo-cellar",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "id": "pw16-1",
          "text": "<p>Without warning, a massive Shadow Beast leaps from the treeline! Its claws tear through the foliage as it snarls at you.</p>"
        }
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "cw16-fight-radiant",
          "text": "Strike it down with the Radiant Sword!",
          "targetPageId": "page-woods-18",
          "conditionals": [
